{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 15812571757234891695,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Continuous integration with GitHub Actions",
      "source_hash": 14106257649520360530,
      "context_hash": 10027477611852751971,
      "translation": "GitHub Actions를 이용한 지속적 통합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855539Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Set up [GitHub Actions](https://github.com/features/actions) as your continuous integration (CI) workflow for commits and pull requests.",
      "source_hash": 16294686577816179822,
      "context_hash": 18114544491556410230,
      "translation": "커밋과 풀 리퀘스트를 위한 지속적 통합(CI) 워크플로로 [GitHub Actions](https://github.com/features/actions)를 설정하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855539Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Nix lets CI build and cache developer environments for every project on every branch using binary caches.",
      "source_hash": 1253656094351052625,
      "context_hash": 11532042441114108113,
      "translation": "Nix를 사용하면 CI가 바이너리 캐시를 이용해 모든 프로젝트의 모든 브랜치에서 개발 환경을 빌드하고 캐시할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "binary caches": "바이너리 캐시",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855540Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Build time is a key CI metric.",
      "source_hash": 16004065352365720411,
      "context_hash": 18070911006136158499,
      "translation": "빌드 시간은 CI의 핵심 지표입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855540Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Cachix (below) is the most straightforward caching option.",
      "source_hash": 7759006956552480931,
      "context_hash": 8179916669908671002,
      "translation": "Cachix(아래 참조)는 가장 간단한 캐싱 옵션입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Cachix": "Cachix",
        "option": "옵션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855540Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Caching builds using Cachix",
      "source_hash": 11017391860068922611,
      "context_hash": 1439923585983854027,
      "translation": "Cachix를 이용한 빌드 캐싱",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Cachix": "Cachix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855542Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Using [Cachix](https://cachix.org/) you'll never have to waste time building a derivation twice, and you'll share built derivations with all your developers.",
      "source_hash": 18264402798448692043,
      "context_hash": 5987876682422840774,
      "translation": "[Cachix](https://cachix.org/)를 사용하면 derivation을 두 번 빌드하느라 시간을 낭비할 일이 없으며, 빌드된 derivation을 모든 개발자와 공유할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Cachix": "Cachix",
        "derivation": "derivation",
        "derivations": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855542Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "After each job, just-built derivations are pushed to your binary cache.",
      "source_hash": 7957652062018247393,
      "context_hash": 16757958832756291659,
      "translation": "각 작업이 끝난 후, 방금 빌드된 derivation은 바이너리 캐시로 푸시됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivations": "derivation",
        "binary cache": "바이너리 캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855543Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Before each job, derivations to be built are first substituted (if they exist) from your binary cache.",
      "source_hash": 3499166219279294568,
      "context_hash": 15882207120271167837,
      "translation": "각 작업이 시작되기 전, 빌드할 derivation은 먼저 바이너리 캐시에 존재할 경우 그것으로 대체됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivations": "derivation",
        "binary cache": "바이너리 캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855543Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "1.",
      "source_hash": 4093818885034029453,
      "context_hash": 13991890020262149290,
      "translation": "1.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855544Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Creating your first binary cache",
      "source_hash": 10554640011663097164,
      "context_hash": 9897797383029372182,
      "translation": "첫 번째 바이너리 캐시 만들기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "binary cache": "바이너리 캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855544Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "It's recommended to have different binary caches per team, depending on who will have write/read access to it.",
      "source_hash": 9690803466656543049,
      "context_hash": 11276811104311660628,
      "translation": "팀별로 다른 바이너리 캐시를 두는 것이 권장되며, 이는 누가 쓰기/읽기 권한을 가질지에 따라 달라집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "binary caches": "바이너리 캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855544Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Fill out the form on the [create binary cache](https://app.cachix.org/cache) page.",
      "source_hash": 1330476177790993535,
      "context_hash": 1968015040437865039,
      "translation": "[바이너리 캐시 생성](https://app.cachix.org/cache) 페이지의 양식을 작성하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "binary cache": "바이너리 캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855544Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "On your freshly created binary cache, follow the **Push binaries** tab instructions.",
      "source_hash": 8883388338376612914,
      "context_hash": 2193108568705221860,
      "translation": "새로 생성한 바이너리 캐시에서 **Push binaries** 탭의 안내를 따르십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "binary cache": "바이너리 캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855545Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "2.",
      "source_hash": 1210270714770233551,
      "context_hash": 15765801880727958058,
      "translation": "2.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855545Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Setting up secrets",
      "source_hash": 10755805303884522332,
      "context_hash": 1484374105493594558,
      "translation": "시크릿 설정하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855545Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "On your GitHub repository or organization (for use across all repositories):",
      "source_hash": 898002882028313134,
      "context_hash": 490517666558196857,
      "translation": "GitHub 저장소 또는 조직에서(모든 저장소에 걸쳐 사용하려는 경우):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855545Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Click on `Settings`.",
      "source_hash": 6467105056687218889,
      "context_hash": 18264741522541087390,
      "translation": "`Settings`를 클릭하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855545Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Click on `Secrets and variables` and click on `Actions` in dropdown list",
      "source_hash": 8023932105469612912,
      "context_hash": 5704352807122103191,
      "translation": "`Secrets and variables`를 클릭한 다음 드롭다운 목록에서 `Actions`를 클릭하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855545Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Click on `New repository secret`.",
      "source_hash": 15738947728030512299,
      "context_hash": 10517755481255581198,
      "translation": "`New repository secret`을 클릭하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855545Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Add your previously generated secrets (`CACHIX_SIGNING_KEY` and/or `CACHIX_AUTH_TOKEN`).",
      "source_hash": 3690537731416614869,
      "context_hash": 17721849825834649935,
      "translation": "이전에 생성한 시크릿(`CACHIX_SIGNING_KEY` 및/또는 `CACHIX_AUTH_TOKEN`)을 추가하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855545Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "3.",
      "source_hash": 414013015342266677,
      "context_hash": 12997354031300971512,
      "translation": "3.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855546Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:14/seg:1",
      "source": "Setting up GitHub Actions",
      "source_hash": 10474046244030637748,
      "context_hash": 77122196386288968,
      "translation": "GitHub Actions 설정하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855546Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Create `.github/workflows/test.yml` with:",
      "source_hash": 14544805053042723135,
      "context_hash": 2080939292517768438,
      "translation": "다음 내용으로 `.github/workflows/test.yml`을 생성하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855546Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Once you commit and push to your GitHub repository, you should see status checks appearing on commits and PRs.",
      "source_hash": 16252508332163281965,
      "context_hash": 4582558847878136948,
      "translation": "GitHub 저장소에 커밋하고 푸시하면, 커밋과 PR에 상태 확인이 나타나는 것을 볼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855546Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Next steps",
      "source_hash": 16066775224842874840,
      "context_hash": 16795438509512458990,
      "translation": "다음 단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855546Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [GitHub Actions workflow syntax](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflow-syntax-for-github-actions)",
      "source_hash": 10744445524588117947,
      "context_hash": 12558376607289615715,
      "translation": "[GitHub Actions 워크플로 문법](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflow-syntax-for-github-actions)을 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855546Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "To quickly set up a Nix project read through [Getting started Nix template](https://github.com/nix-dot-dev/getting-started-nix-template).",
      "source_hash": 7935683259544851202,
      "context_hash": 16791764333756873945,
      "translation": "Nix 프로젝트를 빠르게 설정하려면 [Getting started Nix template](https://github.com/nix-dot-dev/getting-started-nix-template)을 읽어보십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:45.855546Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}